      "content": "How should I spend my coins? \n- finish gold totem resonance as priority \n\nBut why should I go for steak? They add so little CP…. \n\nWe focus on totems purely because of the effects it carries! \n\nCritical state \n- you cant die when you’re at 1% HP for 0.6s\n\nWhat totem has critical state? \n- steak, celebrity only these 2 have them!",
