      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "What about the other totems? What the heck is stability? \n\nStability SHOULD be the immunity to knock backs!\n\nIs it important? Of course! But should you do all of them? No. Purely acquire them from LOC instead of spending guild coins for it, unless you are extremely confident you can get more than 12k coins a weeek from guild. \n\nOtherwise get what you require!",
